<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK</p>
<p>company results expected in week ending June 6 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS-----CONSENSUS-----RANGE------PVS </p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, June 4</p>
<p>Allied Colloids Plc   F    PFT	    53.3	  52.0-54.0  42.1</p>
<p>				   DIV	     3.15	    3.15     2.9</p>
<p>				   EPS	     6.5	   6.5-6.8    5.8</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's estimate directory shows a consensus</p>
<p>forecast of PFT 54.0 DIV 3.15 EPS 6.8)</p>
<p>British Energy Plc    F    PFT	    61.9	  56.0-67.0   N/A</p>
<p>				   DIV	    13.7	     13.7     N/A</p>
<p>				   EPS	     5.5	   4.9-6.5    N/A</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's estimate directory shows a consensus</p>
<p>forecast of PFT 62.8 DIV 13.7 EPS 5.4)</p>
<p>Powerscreen Plc	 F    PFT	    42.4	  41.2-43.2   36.0</p>
<p>				   DIV	    10.5	  10.3-10.5    9.2</p>
<p>				   EPS	    36.2	  35.9-36.5   30.5</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's estimate directory shows a consensus forecast of PFT 42.1 DIV 10.5 EPS 35.6)</p>
<p>Southern Electric Plc F    PFT	  +257.3	 227.0-275.0   283.0</p>
<p>				   DIV	    23.4	  21.5-23.4     20.8</p>
<p>				   EPS	    42.3	  40.0-44.0     49.0</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's estimate directory shows a consensus</p>
<p>forecast of PFT 260.2 DIV 21.5 EPS 41.4)</p>
<p>THURSDAY, June 5</p>
<p>Boots Plc		 F    PFT	   532.2	 526.0-540.0   493.5</p>
<p>				   DIV	    20.2	  20.0-20.5     18.5</p>
<p>				   EPS	    39.3	  38.0-41.1     34.7</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's estimate directory shows a consensus forecast of PFT 535.5 DIV 20.4 EPS 39.4)</p>
<p>Pilkington Plc	  F    PFT	   130.9	 130.0-135.0    212.0</p>
<p>				   DIV	     5.0	     5.0	    5.0</p>
<p>				   EPS	     5.2	   4.7-6.2	  5.2</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's estimate directory shows a</p>
<p>consensus forecast of PFT 130.0 DIV 5.0 EPS 5.7)</p>
<p>Powell Duffryn Plc    F    PFT	    43.1	  40.5-45.0	42.2</p>
<p>				   DIV	    25.0	  25.0-25.5	25.0</p>
<p>				   EPS	    33.0	  28.3-34.5	32.4</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's estimate directory shows a consensus</p>
<p>forecast of PFT 43.8 DIV 25.0 EPS 33.1)</p>
<p>Railtrack Plc	   F    PFT	***302.0	 298.0-308.0    190.0</p>
<p>				   DIV	  ++22.0	  22.0-22.5	20.6</p>
<p>				   EPS	    52.7	  48.0-52.7	42.8</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's estimate directory shows a consensus</p>
<p>forecast of PFT 305.0 DIV 22.0 EPS 51.5)</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>* Figure adjusted for 18.3 million stg charge relating to the restructuring of the group's cash handling division.</p>
<p>** Figure includes capital gains from disposal of Sonofon by NordicTel and Orbitel to Ericsson.</p>
<p>*** Figures are based on FRS3 Accounting Standards</p>
<p>+ Figures adjusted for capital restructuring announced on January 31</p>
<p>++ Total dividend forecast is the sum of the final dividend forecast and interim dividend of 7.3p</p>
<p>Andrew Langlands , London Newsroom +44 171 542 3496</p>
